# Idea Overview

Pocket Smart AI is an AI-powered smart assistant designed to provide useful assistance through a simple interface.

The application accepts user input and provides an AI-generated response based on the user's request.

The main idea is to create a lightweight and easy-to-use AI assistant that can support users in learning, information retrieval, content generation, and general day-to-day assistance.

## Core Idea

User Input → Pocket Smart AI → AI Processing → Generated Response

## Key Features

- Simple user interface
- AI-powered responses
- Easy interaction
- Quick information assistance
- User-friendly design
- Web-based accessibility
